.title  Perspective is one divide
.what   Two similar triangles make x' = x*d/z - lesson 0E's cube with one IDIV per coordinate, then the same without the divide through a table of d/z, and the near plane as the difference between a table that lies and a divide that traps
.tier   LESSON
.main   PERSP.ASM
.needs  DRAW15.INC SINTAB.INC RECIP.INC
.reads  INFOGR.PAS
.build  FASM PERSP.ASM PERSP.COM
.run    PERSP.COM
.uses   XLATB IMUL IDIV SAR CBW MUL LOOP INT
.ignore MAKEINFO.BAT
